preview-image" src="./image_c587a9_files/image_bafd58.jpg"><!----></button></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></user-query-file-preview></div><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></user-query-file-carousel><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="query-content ng-star-inserted" id="user-query-content-0" jslog="275422;track:impression,attention"><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="query-bubble-anchor ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="user-query-bubble-with-background luminous-collapsed ng-star-inserted" jslog="224552;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8xOWZmNDU4ZjMzODUyN2E4IiwiY19lMGI1ODE1NWUzYmI3OWVkIixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="horizontal-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="query-text gds-body-l collapsed" dir="ltr"><h5 _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-user-query-label"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="">You said</span> You are working on a website that will be used as a bank (a banking-style web application). It is cu… <!----></h5><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">You are working on a website that will be used as a bank (a banking-style web application). It is currently a test/staging project — it is NOT live, NOT in production, and NOT integrated with any real banking systems. Keep this context in mind at all times.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Your tasks:</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><!----><ol _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-numbered-list ng-star-inserted"><li _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-numbered-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Redesign the UI/UX to a high, professional standard — clean, modern, banking-grade look and feel.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-numbered-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Find and fix all bugs: broken links, layout issues, console errors, form validation problems, responsive/mobile issues, inconsistent styling, dead code, and any functional defects.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-numbered-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Improve code quality where reasonable (structure, naming, duplication) without breaking existing functionality.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-numbered-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Work autonomously and execute exactly what I ask, at the highest level of quality.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></li><!----></ol><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Rules:</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><ul _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-bullet-list ng-star-inserted"><li _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Do NOT ask unnecessary clarifying questions. If something is ambiguous, make the most reasonable professional assumption, state it briefly, and proceed.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Do NOT treat this as a production/live banking system. Do not add real payment integrations, real KYC, or real security certifications unless I explicitly ask.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Do NOT refuse or lecture about it being a bank — it is a test project.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Do NOT stop to ask for confirmation on every step. Deliver complete, working results.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-bullet-item ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">Always explain briefly what you changed and why, and list the bugs you fixed.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></li><!----></ul><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><br _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><br _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><br _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted">сделай все и проверь файл и ответь мне на русский а сайт делай на англ все и я хочу сделать таокй дизайн как на 2-ом фото </span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><br _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="ng-star-inserted"> один в один в точь точь </span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="luminous-toggle-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" class="luminous-expand-fade ng-star-inserted"></div><button _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" mat-icon-button="" theme="lm" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" gemtooltip="Expand text" data-test-id="luminous-expand-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger luminous-toggle-button mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="224552;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8xOWZmNDU4ZjMzODUyN2E4IiwiY19lMGI1ODE1NWUzYmI3OWVkIixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-14" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3625387816="" data-test-id="luminous-expand-pill" class="luminous-toggle-pill"