</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="24">Async / await</h3><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="25"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="25,0,0">Можно использовать в <code data-path-to-node="25,0,0" data-index-in-node="21">app.legacy.js</code>, <code data-path-to-node="25,0,0" data-index-in-node="36">js/*.js</code>, <code data-path-to-node="25,0,0" data-index-in-node="45">worker.js</code></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="25,1,0">Обязательно оборачивать в <b data-path-to-node="25,1,0" data-index-in-node="26">try/catch</b></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="25,2,0">Никогда не оставлять <code data-path-to-node="25,2,0" data-index-in-node="21">await</code> без обработки ошибки</p></li></ul><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-74 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1018527668-74 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8xOWZmNDU4ZjMzODUyN2E4IiwiY19lMGI1ODE1NWUzYmI3OWVkIixudWxsLCJyY182MjZiNWIwOTEyZTkwMDNjIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJ1IixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1018527668-74"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1018527668-74"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c1018527668-74 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-74">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1018527668-74 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1018527668-74 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1669243914="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-35" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Download code" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" _nghost-ng-c1072821698=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1072821698="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="arrow_circle_down" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="arrow_circle_down"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="copy" theme="lm" arialabel="Copy code" gemtooltip="Copy code" data-test-id="gem-copy-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1018527668-74 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1669243914="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-36" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Copy code" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8xOWZmNDU4ZjMzODUyN2E4IiwiY19lMGI1ODE1NWUzYmI3OWVkIixudWxsLCJyY182MjZiNWIwOTEyZTkwMDNjIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJ1IixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutable:true" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" _nghost-ng-c1072821698=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1072821698="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-74"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1018527668-74"><span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">loadUserState</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) </span>{
  <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
    <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> r = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> fetch(WORKER_URL + <span class="hljs-string">'?action=getUserState'</span>, { ... });
    <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> data = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> r.json();
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!data.ok) <span class="hljs-keyword">throw</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">Error</span>(data.error);
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> data;
  } <span class="hljs-keyword">catch</span> (e) {
    <span class="hljs-built_in">console</span>.error(<span class="hljs-string">'[loadUserState]'</span>, e);
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>;
  }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="27">Работа с DOM</h3><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="28"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="28,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="28,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">$('id')</code></b> = <code data-path-to-node="28,0,0" data-index-in-node="10">document.getElementById('id')</code> (определено в app.legacy.js)</p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="28,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="28,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">document.querySelectorAll</code></b> для множественных элементов</p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="28,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="28,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">document.querySelector</code></b> для одного</p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="28,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Никогда не использовать jQuery</b></p></li></ul><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="29">Работа с API</h3><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="30"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="30,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="30,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Всегда <code data-path-to-node="30,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">fetch</code></b> с <code data-path-to-node="30,0,0" data-index-in-node="15">{method, headers, body}</code></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="30,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="30,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Всегда проверять</b> <code data-path-to-node="30,1,0" data-index-in-node="17">data.ok</code> (worker возвращает <code data-path-to-node="30,1,0" data-index-in-node="44">{ok: true/false}</code>)</p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="30,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="30,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Retry</b> на 5xx через <code data-path-to-node="30,2,0" data-index-in-node="19">fetchRetry</code> (есть в landing.js)</p></li></ul><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-75 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1018527668-75 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8xOWZmNDU4ZjMzODUyN2E4IiwiY19lMGI1ODE1NWUzYmI3OWVkIixudWxsLCJyY182MjZiNWIwOTEyZTkwMDNjIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJ1IixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1018527668-75"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1018527668-75"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c1018527668-75 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-75">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1018527668-75 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1018527668-75 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-b