</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="32">Безопасность</h3><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="33"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="33,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="33,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Всегда</b> <code data-path-to-node="33,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">escapeHtml(userInput)</code> перед вставкой в HTML</p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="33,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="33,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Никогда</b> не использовать <code data-path-to-node="33,1,0" data-index-in-node="24">innerHTML</code> с user input напрямую</p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="33,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="33,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Никогда</b> не логировать <code data-path-to-node="33,2,0" data-index-in-node="22">password</code>, <code data-path-to-node="33,2,0" data-index-in-node="32">token</code>, <code data-path-to-node="33,2,0" data-index-in-node="39">cvv</code></p></li></ul><h2 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="34">🎨 CSS</h2><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="35">Наименование классов (BEM-like)</h3><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-76 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c10185