"> — их нужно удалить из <code data-path-to-node="85,0,1,1,0,2" data-index-in-node="23">app.html</code>, а пути для остальных 5 исправить на корневые.</span></p></li><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="" class="consolidated-sources"><!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from ZIP: nordic-crypto-demo-main (1).zip. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 48ch;">nordic-crypto-demo-main (1).zip</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></ul></li><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-94"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,1,0" id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-118"><span data-path-to-node="85,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="85,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Битая ссылка в <code data-path-to-node="85,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="15">index.html</code> и обрезанный путь в <code data-path-to-node="85,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="46">iphone.html</code></b></span><span data-path-to-node="85,1,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="85,1,0,2">:</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from ZIP: nordic-crypto-demo-main (1).zip. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">nordic-crypto-demo-main (1).zip</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,1,1"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,1,1,0,0">В <code data-path-to-node="85,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="2">index.html</code> ссылка <code data-path-to-node="85,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="20">/app</code> на статическом хостинге (GitHub Pages) без rewrite-правил отдает 404 — следует заменить на <code data-path-to-node="85,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="116">app.html</code>.</p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,1,1,1,0">В <code data-path-to-node="85,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="2">iphone.html</code> атрибут <code data-path-to-node="85,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="22">src="iphone-"</code> не завершен (отсутствует код языка и <code data-path-to-node="85,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="73">.jpg</code>).</p></li></ul></li><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-95"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,2,0"><span data-path-to-node="85,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="85,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Застревание на пустом экране / <code data-path-to-node="85,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="31">pendingScreen</code> после KYC (<code data-path-to-node="85,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="56">.ai/known-issues.md</code>)</b></span><span data-path-to-node="85,2,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="85,2,0,2">:</span></p><ul data-citation-layout="consolidated" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,2,1" id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-120"><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-96"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,0">В <code data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="2">js/app.legacy.js</code> (<code data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="20">submitRealVerification</code>) и проверке экрана используется <code data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="75">st.user.verified</code> вместо <code data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="99">st.verification.status</code></span><span data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,2">. При смене статуса на <code data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,2" data-index-in-node="23">approved</code> на бэкенде клиент остается на <code data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,2" data-index-in-node="62">pendingScreen</code></span><span data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,3"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,4">. Исправляется проверкой <code data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,4" data-index-in-node="25">st.verification.status === 'approved'</code> и принудительным закрытием <code data-path-to-node="85,2,1,0,0,4" data-index-in-node="90">pendingScreen</code>.</span></p></li><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="" class="consolidated-sources"><!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from ZIP: nordic-crypto-demo-main (1).zip. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 48ch;">nordic-crypto-demo-main (1).zip</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></ul></li><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-97"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,3,0"><span data-path-to-node="85,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="85,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Несоответствие сетки и визуальной иерархии макету (фото 2)</b></span><span data-path-to-node="85,3,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="85,3,0,2">:</span></p><ul data-citation-layout="consolidated" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,3,1" id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-121"><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-98"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0">Текущий <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="8">bankdash-pro.js</code> использует 2-колоночную сетку (<code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="55">1fr 390px</code>), где карточки свалены в одну длинную ленту, отсутствует панорамный нордический фон шапки (горы/фьорд с плавным градиентом в <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="190">#060d13</code>), отсутствует кольцевая диаграмма <b data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="232">Portfolio Composition</b>, блок <b data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="260">Your Account is Protected</b>, панель быстрых действий справа от карты (<code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="328">Add Money +</code>, <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="341">Withdraw</code>, <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="351">Exchange</code>, <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="361">Scan Deposits</code>, <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="376">Bonus</code>, <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="383">Wallets</code>), а также 4-колонный мини-тикер активов (<code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="432">USD</code>, <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="437">BTC</code>, <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="442">ETH</code>, <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="447">USDT</code>, <code data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="453">+2 more</code>) под графиком баланса</span><span data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="85,3,1,0,0,2">.</span></p></li><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="" class="consolidated-sources"><!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from JPG: image_bafd58.jpg. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 48ch;">image_bafd58.jpg</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></ul></li></ol><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="87">2. Что изменено в дизайне (1-в-1 по 2-му фото, UI на английском)</h3><ul data-citation-layout="consolidated" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88" id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-122"><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-99"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Атмосфера и палитра</b>: глубокий изумрудно-графитовый фон (<code data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="56">#050b10</code> / <code data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="66">#0a141c</code>), полупрозрачные стеклянные панели (<code data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="110">rgba(11, 22, 30, 0.78)</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="134">backdrop-filter: blur(18px)</code>), мятно-бирюзовый акцент (<code data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="188">#45e6b0</code> / <code data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="198">#2dd4bf</code>) и панорамный баннер с нордическим пейзажем за приветствием (<code data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="267">Good morning, &lt;Name&gt;!</code> / <code data-path-to-node="88,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="291">Your financial freedom starts here</code>)</span><span data-path-to-node="88,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,0,0,2">.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Сайдбар (220px)</b>:</p><ul data-citation-layout="consolidated" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,1,1"><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-100"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,1,1,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,1,1,0,0,0">Логотип <b data-path-to-node="88,1,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="8">NordicCrypto</b> (<code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="22">Banking for a better tomorrow</code>)</span><span data-path-to-node="88,1,1,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,1,1,0,0,2">.</span></p></li><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-101"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0">Активный пункт меню в виде ярко-мятной плашки (<code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="47">Dashboard</code>), ниже: <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="65">My Cards</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="75">Crypto Assets</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="90">Transactions</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="104">Order New Card</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="120">My Wallets</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="132">Receive Crypto</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="148">My Accounts</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="161">Settings</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="171">Support</code></span><span data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,1,1,1,0,2">.</span></p></li><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-102"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,1,1,2,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,1,1,2,0,0">Внизу: карточка <b data-path-to-node="88,1,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="16">Premium Account</b> с градиентным кристаллом и кнопкой <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="67">Upgrade Plan -&gt;</code>, а также профиль пользователя с аватаром, именем и статусом <code data-path-to-node="88,1,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="143">Premium Member</code></span><span data-path-to-node="88,1,1,2,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,1,1,2,0,2">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Верхняя панель (Topbar)</b>:</p><ul data-citation-layout="consolidated" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,2,1"><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-103"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,2,1,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,2,1,0,0,0">Поле поиска <code data-path-to-node="88,2,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="12">Search transactions, cards, assets...</code> с бейджем <code data-path-to-node="88,2,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="60">⌘ K</code></span><span data-path-to-node="88,2,1,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,2,1,0,0,2">.</span></p></li><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-104"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,2,1,1,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,2,1,1,0,0">Справа: иконка подарка (Bonus), бейдж лояльности (<code data-path-to-node="88,2,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="50">NC 775 NC | Silver</code>), переключатель языка (<code data-path-to-node="88,2,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="92">EN</code>), режим (<code data-path-to-node="88,2,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="104">Banking</code>), переключатель темы, шестеренка настроек и пилюля статуса <code data-path-to-node="88,2,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="171">● Connected</code></span><span data-path-to-node="88,2,1,1,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,2,1,1,0,2">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Верхний ряд (3 колонки)</b>:</p><ol start="1" data-citation-layout="consolidated" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,3,1"><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-105"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Total Balance</b>: крупная сумма (<code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">$35,924.19</code>) с иконкой скрытия баланса, дельта за 24ч (<code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="84">▲ +$350.21 +1.25% (24h)</code>), переключатель периодов (<code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="134">1D</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="138">7D</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="142">1M</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="146">3M</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="150">1Y</code> — активный в виде мятной пилюли), плавный area-график с изумрудным градиентом и шкалой справа (<code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="248">$33k–$36k</code>) и времени снизу (<code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="276">00:00</code> – <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="284">24:00</code>), а под графиком — ряд из 4 активов (<code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="327">USD</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="332">BTC</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="337">ETH</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="342">USDT</code>) + кнопка <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="357">+2 more</code></span><span data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,3,1,0,0,2">.</span></p></li><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-106"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Виртуальная/металлическая карта</b>: дизайн в темном изумрудном стекле со световой волной, логотипом <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="97">N NordicCrypto</code>, статусом <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="122">● Active</code>, золотым EMV-чипом и иконкой бесконтактной оплаты, номером <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="190">**** **** **** 4827</code>, логотипом <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="221">VISA</code>, строкой <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="235">Available Balance</code> + кнопкой <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="263">Manage Card -&gt;</code>, и 4 круглыми кнопками под картой (<code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="313">Freeze</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="321">Limits</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="329">Copy</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="335">Settings</code>)</span><span data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,3,1,1,0,2">.</span></p></li><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-107"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Правая панель действий</b>: крупная акцентная кнопка <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="49">Add Money +</code> и вертикальный стек из 5 темных стеклянных кнопок: <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="112">Withdraw</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="122">Exchange</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="132">Scan Deposits</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="147">Bonus</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="154">Wallets</code></span><span data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,3,1,2,0,2">.</span></p></li></ol></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Нижний ряд (3 колонки)</b>:</p><ol start="1" data-citation-layout="consolidated" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,4,1"><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-108"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Recent Transactions</b> (<code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="21">View all -&gt;</code>): список операций с цветными квадратными иконками, датой/временем и суммой (<code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="109">+$5,000.00</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="121">-0.015 BTC</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="133">-$1,250.00</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="145">+$100.00</code>)</span><span data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="88,4,1,0,0,2">.</span></p></li><li id="p-rc_626b5b0912e9003c-109"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="88,4,1,1,0"><span data-path-to-node="88,4,1,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="88,4,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Portfolio Composition</b>: толстый кольцевой график (donut chart) с суммой <code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="71">$35,924 Total Value</code> в центре и легендой справа (<code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="119">BTC 42.8%</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="130">ETH 28.1%</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="141">USDT 18.3%</code>, <code data-path-to-node="88,4,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="153">Others 10.8%</code>)</span><span data-path-to-node="88,4,1,1,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->