container _ngcontent-ng-c212636251="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c743029074="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c743029074="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c743029074="" _nghost-ng-c3963261838="" id="message-content-id-r_c747f7738cbb8d6c" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3963261838="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_c747f7738cbb8d6c" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="">Этап 2: Обновление скрипта дашборда (<code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="37">js/bankdash-pro.js</code>)</h3><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><span>Я также исправил две синтаксические опечатки из прошлого черновика (в формулах </span><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="79">mapY</code><span> и </span><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="86">C = 2 * Math.PI * R</code><span>),</span><span> чтобы график баланса и кольцевая диаграмма отрисовывались без единой ошибки в консоли.</span></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0">Что делать:</b></p><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><span>Откройте в папке проекта файл </span><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="30"><code data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">js/bankdash-pro.js</code></b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><span>Выделите </span><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="9">всё</b><span> содержимое этого файла (</span><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="37">Ctrl + A</code><span>) и удалите его.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><span>Вставьте приведенный ниже код целиком и сохраните файл (</span><code data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="56" class="">Ctrl + S</code><span class="">).</span></p></li></ol><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="--animation-duration: 900ms;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-103 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1018527668-103 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9jNzQ3Zjc3MzhjYmI4ZDZjIiwiY19lMGI1ODE1NWUzYmI3OWVkIixudWxsLCJyY185ZTdjZWE1NTAwOTBmMzI1IixudWxsLG51bGwsInJ1IixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1018527668-103"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1018527668-103"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c1018527668-103 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-103">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1018527668-103 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1018527668-103 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1669243914="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-35" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noop