c2769656198="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c2769656198-143"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c2769656198-143" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2769656198-143"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2769656198-143"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" _nghost-ng-c1736667941="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini said</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" _nghost-ng-c212636251=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c212636251="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c212636251="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c743029074="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c743029074="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c743029074="" _nghost-ng-c3963261838="" id="message-content-id-r_29c213be755b49ab" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3963261838="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_29c213be755b49ab" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span class="">Да,</span><span> совершенно верно — в адресной строке браузера при переходе в личный кабинет будет отображаться </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="99">[ваш-домен.com/app.html](https://ваш-домен.com/app.html)</code><span> (или при наведении на кнопку).</span></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><span>Это зависит от того,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="21">где именно у вас размещен сайт</b><span>:</span></p><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Если у вас Cloudflare Pages / Netlify / Vercel или свой сервер (Nginx/Apache):</b><span>
Там обычно работают красивые адреса без </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="119">.html</code><span> (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="126">[ваш-домен.com/app](https://ваш-домен.com/app)</code><span>),</span><span> и сервер сам подставляет </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="200">app.html</code><span>.</span><span> Если вы используете такой хостинг,</span><span> то в </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="250">index.html</code><span> можно </span><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="267">оставить <code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="276">/app</code></b><span> — менять на </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="293">app.html</code><span> не нужно.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Если у вас GitHub Pages (или обычный простой хостинг без настроек переадресации):</b><span>
GitHub Pages часто отдает ошибку </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="115">404 Not Found</code><span> при переходе на </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="145">/app</code><span> (если в папке нет файла </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="174">app</code><span> без расширения),</span><span> но при переходе на </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="214">app.html</code><span> открывается без проблем.</span></p></li></ol><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">Что делать прямо сейчас:</b></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4" data-citation-layout="per-item"><li id="p-rc_5b0e67883ceabd3e-130"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4,0,0" id="p-rc_5b0e67883ceabd3e-131"><span data-path-to-node="4,0,0,0">Если у вас <b data-path-to-node="4,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">Cloudflare Pages</b> (в проекте есть файлы <code data-path-to-node="4,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="50">_redirects</code> и <code data-path-to-node="4,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="63">wrangler.toml</code>, которые настроены под Cloudflare</span><span data-path-to-node="4,0,0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="4,0,0,2">) — <b data-path-to-node="4,0,0,2" data-index-in-node="4">оставьте в <code data-path-to-node="4,0,0,2" data-index-in-node="15">index.html</code> как было (<code data-path-to-node="4,0,0,2" data-index-in-node="36">/app</code>)</b>, чтобы ссылки оставались красивыми без <code data-path-to-node="4,0,0,2" data-index-in-node="81">.html</code>.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from ZIP: nordic-crypto-demo-main (1).zip. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">nordic-crypto-demo-main (1).zip</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><span>Если при клике на вход у вас вылезала ошибка 404 — тогда используйте замену на </span><code data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="79">app.html</code><span>.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5"><span>Как определитесь с </span><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="19">index.html</code><span> — напишите </span><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="41">«этап 5»</b><span>,</span><span> и разберем файл </span><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="67">iphone.html</code><span>!</span></p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" _nghost-ng-c3304081241="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" _nghost-ng-c2433247864="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" _nghost-ng-c4145778840="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2769656198-143 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c1283628023-144 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1283628023="" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1283628023="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1283628023-144"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1283628023="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c1283628023-144 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c1283628023="" _nghost-ng-c2549436995="" class="ng-tns-c1283628023-144 luminous-theme ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2549436995="" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="Good response" gemtooltip="Good response" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-b