div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c2769656198-166"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c2769656198-166"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c2769656198-166" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2769656198-166"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2769656198-166"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" _nghost-ng-c1736667941="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini said</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" _nghost-ng-c212636251=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c212636251="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c212636251="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c743029074="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c743029074="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c743029074="" _nghost-ng-c3963261838="" id="message-content-id-r_4aa217ef1618d586" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3963261838="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_4aa217ef1618d586" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token" id="p-rc_3fe812786dfdf16f-132"><span data-path-to-node="0,0" class="">Я внимательно сравнил ваш текущий скриншот (<code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="44">image_c57c67.jpg</code>)</span><span data-path-to-node="0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="0,2"> с эталонным дизайном, который мы разбирали ранее. Главная проблема сейчас в том, что вместо векторных иконок использовались системные текстовые эмодзи (<code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="153">💳</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="157">❄</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="160">🎚</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="164">📋</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="168">⚙</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="171">📷</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="175">🎁</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="179">👛</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="183">🛡</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="187">📅</code>), из-за чего интерфейс выглядит как черновик, а также есть несколько визуальных недочетов:</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from JPG: image_c57c67.jpg. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">image_c57c67.jpg</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1" data-citation-layout="per-item"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Все иконки и ярлычки:</b><span> Системные эмодзи заменены на четкие,</span><span> премиальные векторные SVG-иконки в стиле Lucide/Feather с мягким мятно-бирюзовым свечением,</span><span> а значки монет (USD,</span><span> BTC,</span><span> ETH,</span><span> USDT) — на фирменные векторные логотипы.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Банковская карта:</b><span> Добавлен реалистичный текстурный перелив темного стекла,</span><span> объемный золотой EMV-чип с линиями контактов,</span><span> векторная иконка бесконтактной оплаты NFC,</span><span> правильная типографика номера карты и 4 аккуратные кнопки управления под ней (Freeze,</span><span> Limits,</span><span> Copy,</span><span> Settings) со стильными иконками.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Панорамный фон в шапке:</b><span> За приветствием </span><code data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="40">Good evening, Otis!</code><span> добавлен атмосферный нордический горно-морской пейзаж (фьорд с изумрудным северным сиянием),</span><span> плавно растворяющийся в глубокий графитово-изумрудный фон </span><code data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="211">#050b10</code><span> — без необходимости загружать внешние картинки.</span></p></li><li id="p-rc_3fe812786dfdf16f-133"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,3,0" id="p-rc_3fe812786dfdf16f-135"><span data-path-to-node="1,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Чистота левого меню (сайдбара):</b> На вашем скриншоте внизу меню дублируются <code data-path-to-node="1,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="74">My accounts</code> и <code data-path-to-node="1,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="88">Explore</code> (их добавляет скрипт <code data-path-to-node="1,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="117">pages-pro.js</code> или <code data-path-to-node="1,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="134">explore-pro.js</code> поверх нашего списка)</span><span data-path-to-node="1,3,0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="1,3,0,2">. Новый CSS автоматически скроет дубликаты, чтобы меню было ровно таким, как на эталоне.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from JPG: image_c57c67.jpg. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">image_c57c67.jpg</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li id="p-rc_3fe812786dfdf16f-134"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,4,0" id="p-rc_3fe812786dfdf16f-136"><span data-path-to-node="1,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Кнопки действий и блок безопасности:</b> Все 6 кнопок справа (<code data-path-to-node="1,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="58">Add Money +</code>, <code data-path-to-node="1,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="71">Withdraw</code>, <code data-path-to-node="1,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="81">Exchange</code>, <code data-path-to-node="1,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="91">Scan Deposits</code>, <code data-path-to-node="1,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="106">Bonus</code>, <code data-path-to-node="1,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="113">Wallets</code>), пилюля даты <code data-path-to-node="1,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="135">Thursday, 26 November 2026</code></span><span data-path-to-node="1,4,0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="1,4,0,2"> и блок <code data-path-to-node="1,4,0,2" data-index-in-node="8">Your Account is Protected</code> (с крупным полупрозрачным векторным щитом на фоне) переведены на единую систему векторных SVG-иконок.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from JPG: image_c57c67.jpg. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">image_c57c67.jpg</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ol><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><span>Чтобы не запутаться,</span><span> сделаем это </span><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="33">в 2 шага</b><span> (замена </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="50">css/bankdash-pro.css</code><span> и замена </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="80">js/bankdash-pro.js</code><span>).</span></p><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4">Шаг 1 из 2: Полная замена стилей (<code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="34">css/bankdash-pro.css</code>)</h3><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><span>Откройте файл </span><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="14"><code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="14">css/bankdash-pro.css</code></b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><span>Выделите </span><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="9">всё</b><span> содержимое (</span><code data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="25">Ctrl + A</code><span>) и удалите его.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5,2,0"><span>Вставьте этот улучшенный код целиком и сохраните (</span><code data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="50" class="">Ctrl + S</code><span class="">):</span></p></li></ol><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="--animation-duration: 900ms;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-167 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1018527668-167 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80YWEyMTdlZjE2MThkNTg2IiwiY19lMGI1ODE1NWUzYmI3OWVkIixudWxsLCJyY18zZmU4MTI3ODZkZmRmMTZmIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJ1IixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1018527668-167"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1018527668-167"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c1018527668-167 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-167">CSS</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1018527668-167 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1018527668-167 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1669243914="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-35" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Download code" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" _nghost-ng-c1072821698=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1072821698="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="arrow_circle_down" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="arrow_circle_down"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span><span class="mat-ripple mat-mdc-button-ripple"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="copy" theme="lm" arialabel="Copy code" gemtooltip="Copy code" data-test-id="gem-copy-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1018527668-167 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1669243914="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-36" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Copy code" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80YWEyMTdlZjE2MThkNTg2IiwiY19lMGI1ODE1NWUzYmI3OWVkIixudWxsLCJyY18zZmU4MTI3ODZkZmRmMTZmIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJ1IixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutable:true" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" _nghost-ng-c1072821698=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1072821698="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span><span class="mat-ripple mat-mdc-button-ripple"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-167"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1018527668-167"><span class="hljs-comment">/* NORDIC CRYPTO — Banking Dashboard PRO v3.0 (Nordic Emerald Glass &amp; Vector UI) */</span>
<span class="hljs-selector-id">#dash</span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.bd-on</span> &gt; <span class="hljs-selector-pseudo">:not</span>(<span class="hljs-selector-id">#bd</span>) { <span class="hljs-attribute">display</span>: none <span class="hljs-meta">!important</span>; }

<span class="hljs-selector-tag">body</span> {
  <span class="hljs-attribute">background</span>: <span class="hljs-number">#050b10</span> <span class="hljs-meta">!important</span>;
  <span class="hljs-attribute">color</span>: <span class="hljs-number">#eef5f8</span> <span class="hljs-meta">!important</span>;
}

<span class="hljs-comment">/* Panoramic Nordic Fjord &amp; Aurora Header Backdrop (Built-in SVG + Multi-layer Gradient) */</span>
<span class="hljs-selector-id">#mainApp</span> {
  <span class="hljs-attribute">position</span>: relative;
  <span class="hljs-attribute">background-color</span>: <span class="hljs-number">#050b10</span> <span class="hljs-meta">!important</span>;
  <span class="hljs-attribute">background-image</span>:
    <span class="hljs-built_in">linear-gradient</span>(<span class="hljs-number">180deg</span>, <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">5</span>, <span class="hljs-number">12</span>, <span class="hljs-number">18</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.18</span>) <span class="hljs-number">0%</span>, <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">5</span>, <span class="hljs-number">11</span>, <span class="hljs-number">16</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.72</span>) <span class="hljs-number">230px</span>, <span class="hljs-number">#050b10</span> <span class="hljs-number">390px</span>),
    <span class="hljs-built_in">radial-gradient</span>(<span class="hljs-number">950px</span> <span class="hljs-number">320px</span> at <span class="hljs-number">62%</span> <span class="hljs-number">0%</span>, <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">45</span>, <span class="hljs-number">212</span>, <span class="hljs-number">191</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.24</span>), transparent <span class="hljs-number">72%</span>),
    <span class="hljs-built_in">radial-gradient</span>(<span class="hljs-number">700px</span> <span class="hljs-number">260px</span> at <span class="hljs-number">22%</span> <span class="hljs-number">5%</span>, <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">14</span>, <span class="hljs-number">165</span>, <span class="hljs-number">233</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.16</span>), transparent <span class="hljs-number">70%</span>),
    <span class="hljs-built_in">url</span>(<span class="hljs-string">"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1600 420' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid slice'%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient id='sky' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='1'%3E%3Cstop offset='0%25' stop-color='%23091e26'/%3E%3Cstop offset='55%25' stop-color='%230d2b33'/%3E%3Cstop offset='100%25' stop-color='%23050b10'/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3ClinearGradient id='aurora' x1='0' y1='0' x2='1' y2='0.4'%3E%3Cstop offset='0%25' stop-color='%232dd4bf' stop-opacity='0.05'/%3E%3Cstop offset='45%25' stop-color='%2345e6b0' stop-opacity='0.28'/%3E%3Cstop offset='80%25' stop-color='%2338bdf8' stop-opacity='0.18'/%3E%3Cstop offset='100%25' stop-color='%232dd4bf' stop-opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect width='1600' height='420' fill='url(%23sky</span>)<span class="hljs-string">'/%3E%3Cpath d='</span>M0,<span class="hljs-number">120</span> Q420,<span class="hljs-number">40</span> <span class="hljs-number">820</span>,<span class="hljs-number">110</span> T1600,<span class="hljs-number">70</span> L1600,<span class="hljs-number">220</span> Q1100,<span class="hljs-number">150</span> <span class="hljs-number">650</span>,<span class="hljs-number">200</span> T0,<span class="hljs-number">180</span> Z<span class="hljs-string">' fill='</span><span class="hljs-built_in">url</span>(<span class="hljs-string">%23aurora</span>)<span class="hljs-string">'/%3E%3Cpath d='</span>M0,<span class="hljs-number">260</span> L190,<span class="hljs-number">155</span> L340,<span class="hljs-number">225</span> L560,<span class="hljs-number">125</span> L790,<span class="hljs-number">235</span> L1040,<span class="hljs-number">135</span> L1290,<span class="hljs-number">220</span> L1480,<span class="hljs-number">145</span> L1600,<span class="hljs-number">200</span> L1600,<span class="hljs-number">420</span> L0,<span class="hljs-number">420</span> Z<span class="hljs-string">' fill='</span>%<span class="hljs-number">2308161</span>f<span class="hljs-string">' opacity='</span><span class="hljs-number">0.88</span><span class="hljs-string">'/%3E%3Cpath d='</span>M0,<span class="hljs-number">295</span> L260,<span class="hljs-number">195</span> L480,<span class="hljs-number">265</span> L720,<span class="hljs-number">175</span> L980,<span class="hljs-number">270</span> L1220,<span class="hljs-number">185</span> L1460,<span class="hljs-number">255</span> L1600,<span class="hljs-number">210</span> L1600,<span class="hljs-number">420</span> L0,<span class="hljs-number">420</span> Z<span class="hljs-string">' fill='</span>%<span class="hljs-number">23061017</span><span class="hljs-string">'/%3E%3Cpath d='</span>M0,<span class="hljs-number">320</span> Q800,<span class="hljs-number">300</span> <span class="hljs-number">1600</span>,<span class="hljs-number">325</span> L1600,<span class="hljs-number">420</span> L0,<span class="hljs-number">420</span> Z<span class="hljs-string">' fill='</span>%<span class="hljs-number">23050</span>b10<span class="hljs-string">'/%3E%3C/svg%3E") !important;
  background-position: center top !important;
  background-size: 100% 420px !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
}

/* Sidebar styling &amp; cleanup duplicate items */
#sideBar.side {
  background: rgba(7, 14, 20, 0.96) !important;
  border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06) !important;
  backdrop-filter: blur(22px);
}

#sideBar .menu .mi {
  border-radius: 12px !important;
  margin: 3px 12px !important;
  padding: 10px 14px !important;
  color: #8ea3b2 !important;
  font-weight: 600 !important;
  font-size: 13.5px !important;
  transition: all 0.18s ease;
}

/* Hide auto-injected duplicate items (My accounts / Explore) so sidebar matches reference */
#sideBar .menu .mi[data-p="accounts"],
#sideBar .menu .mi[data-p="explore"],
#sideBar .menu .mi:nth-child(n+11) {
  display: none !important;
}

#sideBar .menu .mi:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) !important;
  color: #eef5f8 !important;
}

#sideBar .menu .mi.on {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4ae8b5 0%, #2dd4bf 100%) !important;
  color: #041814 !important;
  font-weight: 700 !important;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -6px rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.45) !important;
}

#sideBar .menu .mi.on svg {
  stroke: #041814 !important;
}

/* Main Dashboard Grid */
.bd {
  --bd-bd: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  --bd-bd-hi: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.34);
  --bd-tx: #eef5f8;
  --bd-mut: #7f94a3;
  --bd-mint: #45e6b0;
  --bd-mint-2: #2dd4bf;
  --bd-ink: #041814;
  --bd-up: #34d399;
  --bd-dn: #f87171;

  max-width: 1520px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 8px 10px 48px;
  color: var(--bd-tx);
  font-family: '</span>Inter<span class="hljs-string">', '</span>DM Sans<span class="hljs-string">', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  font-feature-settings: "tnum";
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

.bd *, .bd *::before, .bd *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
.bd button { font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
.bd svg { display: block; flex-shrink: 0; }
.bd.hide .bd-sens { filter: blur(8px); user-select: none; }

/* Greeting Row */
.bd-greet-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  padding: 6px 2px 2px;
}

.bd-greet-title {
  font-size: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 31px);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: #ffffff;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
  text-shadow: 0 2px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
}

.bd-greet-sub {
  font-size: 13.5px;
  color: #a3b8c5;
  margin: 0;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.bd-date-pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 12.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #d6e3ec;
  background: rgba(10, 21, 30, 0.65);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  padding: 8px 14px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.bd-date-pill svg {
  color: var(--bd-mint);
}

/* Top 3-Column Bento Grid */
.bd-top-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.38fr) minmax(330px, 0.94fr) 232px;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

/* Bottom 3-Column Bento Grid */
.bd-bot-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.12fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.98fr);
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

/* Shared Glass Panel */
.bd-panel {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(14, 27, 37, 0.82) 0%, rgba(8, 17, 24, 0.92) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--bd-bd);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 20px 22px;
  backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), 0 20px 44px -26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  min-width: 0;
}

/* Balance Card (Col 1 Top) */
.bd-bal-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}

.bd-bal-lbl {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #b4c6d2;
}

.bd-bal-lbl-ic {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.14);
  border: 1px solid rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.25);
  color: var(--bd-mint);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
}

.bd-rng {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 3px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  padding: 3px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}

.bd-rng button {
  background: transparent;
  border: 0;
  color: #8296a4;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 5px 10px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}

.bd-rng button:hover { color: #fff; }

.bd-rng button.on {
  background: var(--bd-mint);
  color: var(--bd-ink);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.35);
}

.bd-bal-val-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 8px;
}

.bd-bal-num {
  font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 44px);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  color: #ffffff;
  line-height: 1.05;
}

.bd-eye-btn {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
  color: #9cb0bd;
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  border-radius: 9px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  transition: 0.15s;
}

.bd-eye-btn:hover { color: #fff; border-color: var(--bd-bd-hi); background: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.1); }

.bd-bal-delta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  margin-top: 6px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.bd-bal-delta.up { color: var(--bd-up); }
.bd-bal-delta.dn { color: var(--bd-dn); }
.bd-bal-delta small { color: #7f94a3; font-weight: 500; font-size: 12px; }

.bd-chart-box {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 158px;
  margin: 10px 0 8px;
}

.bd-chart-box svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }
.bd-chart-box .ax-txt { fill: #637987; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; }

/* Mini Asset Ticker Strip under Chart */
.bd-asset-strip {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  padding-top: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.bd-mini-coin {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
}

.bd-mini-ic {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #fff;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

.bd-mini-ic.usd { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669); color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.45); }
.bd-mini-ic.btc { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7931a, #d97706); }
.bd-mini-ic.eth { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #627eea, #4338ca); }
.bd-mini-ic.usdt { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #26a17b, #0d9488); }

.bd-mini-meta span { display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #7f94a3; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
.bd-mini-meta b { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #eef5f8; }

.bd-more-coins {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
  border-radius: 8px;
  color: #9cb0bd;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 5px 9px;
  transition: 0.15s;
}

.bd-more-coins:hover { color: var(--bd-mint); border-color: var(--bd-bd-hi); }

/* Bank Card Panel (Col 2 Top) — Realistic Metallic Emerald Glass Card */
.bd-card-visual {
  position: relative;
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(280px 160px at 88% 22%, rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.32), transparent 68%),
    radial-gradient(200px 140px at 12% 90%, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2), transparent 65%),
    linear-gradient(135deg, #0d1f2a 0%, #071219 52%, #0e2c2f 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.28);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18),
    inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
    0 18px 34px -16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* Subtle diagonal glass sheen &amp; wave arcs on card */
.bd-card-visual::before {
  content: '</span><span class="hljs-string">';
  position: absolute;
  right: -35px;
  bottom: -45px;
  width: 190px;
  height: 190px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 22px solid rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.06);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.bd-card-visual::after {
  content: '</span><span class="hljs-string">';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(115deg, transparent 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06) 48%, transparent 64%);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.bd-cv-top {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.bd-cv-brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #fff;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.bd-cv-logo-badge {
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #45e6b0, #0d9488);
  color: #041814;
  font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 13px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.35);
}

.bd-cv-status {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #45e6b0;
  background: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.14);
  border: 1px solid rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.32);
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 999px;
}

.bd-cv-status .dot {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #45e6b0;
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px #45e6b0;
}

.bd-cv-status.frozen {
  color: #60a5fa;
  background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.14);
  border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.32);
}

.bd-cv-status.frozen .dot {
  background: #60a5fa;
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px #60a5fa;
}

.bd-cv-chip-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

/* Realistic Gold EMV Chip */
.bd-emv {
  width: 38px;
  height: 27px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6dc8d 0%, #d4a246 50%, #b58129 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 245, 210, 0.45);
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5), 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.bd-emv::before {
  content: '</span><span class="hljs-string">';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 5px 0;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(90, 60, 10, 0.45);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(90, 60, 10, 0.45);
}

.bd-emv::after {
  content: '</span><span class="hljs-string">';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0 11px;
  border-left: 1px solid rgba(90, 60, 10, 0.45);
  border-right: 1px solid rgba(90, 60, 10, 0.45);
}

.bd-cv-num-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.bd-cv-num {
  font-family: '</span>JetBrains Mono<span class="hljs-string">', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  font-size: 14.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  color: #e6f0f6;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
}

.bd-cv-visa {
  font-size: 21px;
  font-weight: 900;
  font-style: italic;
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  color: #ffffff;
  text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
}

.bd-avail-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin: 14px 0;
  gap: 10px;
}

.bd-avail-lbl { font-size: 11px; color: #7f94a3; font-weight: 600; }
.bd-avail-val { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin-top: 2px; }

.bd-manage-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  color: #e2edf3;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  transition: 0.15s;
}

.bd-manage-btn:hover {
  border-color: var(--bd-mint);
  color: var(--bd-mint);
  background: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.08);
}

.bd-card-ctrls {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 8px;
  padding-top: 10px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}

.bd-cctrl {
  background: transparent;
  border: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  color: #9cb0bd;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 4px 0;
  transition: 0.15s;
}

.bd-cctrl:hover { color: #fff; }

.bd-cctrl-ic {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: #cfe0ea;
  transition: 0.16s;
}

.bd-cctrl:hover .bd-cctrl-ic {
  border-color: var(--bd-mint);
  color: var(--bd-mint);
  background: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.1);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

/* Right Quick Actions Stack (Col 3 Top) */
.bd-qstack {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 9px;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.bd-qbtn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 12px 15px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(14, 27, 37, 0.85) 0%, rgba(9, 19, 27, 0.92) 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  color: #e4eff5;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition: all 0.16s ease;
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
}

.bd-qbtn-l {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

.bd-qbtn-ic {
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  background: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.12);
  color: var(--bd-mint);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
}

.bd-qbtn:hover {
  border-color: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.4);
  background: rgba(18, 35, 47, 0.95);
  transform: translateX(2px);
}

.bd-qbtn.pri {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4ae8b5 0%, #2dd4bf 100%);
  color: #041814;
  font-weight: 800;
  border: 0;
  padding: 15px 16px;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 26px -8px rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.5);
}

.bd-qbtn.pri .bd-qbtn-ic {
  background: rgba(4, 24, 20, 0.14);
  color: #041814;
}

.bd-qbtn.pri:hover {
  filter: brightness(1.05);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

/* Bottom Row Headers */
.bd-sec-hdr {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.bd-sec-hdr h3 {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #ffffff;
  margin: 0;
}

.bd-sec-link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  background: transparent;
  border: 0;
  color: #8fa3b0;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 0;
  transition: 0.15s;
}

.bd-sec-link:hover { color: var(--bd-mint); }

/* Recent Transactions List */
.bd-tx-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 9px;
}

.bd-tx-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  border-radius: 13px;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  text-align: left;
  color: inherit;
  transition: 0.15s;
}

.bd-tx-item:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);
  border-color: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.28);
}

.bd-tx-l {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  min-width: 0;
}

.bd-tx-ic {
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.bd-tx-ic.in { background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.16); color: #34d399; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.25); }
.bd-tx-ic.swap { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.16); color: #fbbf24; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25); }
.bd-tx-ic.out { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.16); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25); }
.bd-tx-ic.bonus { background: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.16); color: #2dd4bf; border: 1px solid rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.25); }

.bd-tx-info b {
  display: block;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #eef5f8;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.bd-tx-info small {
  display: block;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #718796;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.bd-tx-amt {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.bd-tx-amt.up { color: #34d399; }
.bd-tx-amt.dn { color: #f87171; }
.bd-tx-amt.nt { color: #cbd5e1; }

/* Portfolio Composition Donut */
.bd-comp-wrap {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 18px;
  margin: auto 0;
}

.bd-donut-box {
  position: relative;
  width: 146px;
  height: 146px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.bd-donut-center {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.bd-donut-center b { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; }
.bd-donut-center small { font-size: 10px; color: #7f94a3; margin-top: 2px; }

.bd-comp-leg {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 11px;
}

.bd-comp-leg li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.bd-comp-leg li span {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  color: #b7c7d2;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.bd-comp-leg li i {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: inline-block;
}

.bd-comp-leg li b {
  color: #ffffff;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* Security Card (Col 3 Bottom) */
.bd-sec-card {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.bd-sec-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 12px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.bd-sec-shield {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.14);
  border: 1px solid rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.3);
  color: var(--bd-mint);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.bd-sec-top h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 3px; }
.bd-sec-top p { font-size: 12px; color: #7f94a3; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4; }

.bd-sec-list {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 14px 0;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 9px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.bd-sec-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
  font-size: 12.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #c7d6e0;
}

.bd-sec-chk {
  width: 17px;
  height: 17px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.18);
  border: 1px solid rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.35);
  color: var(--bd-mint);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.bd-sec-watermark {
  position: absolute;
  right: 16px;
  bottom: 52px;
  color: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.14);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.bd-sec-btn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 6px;
  width: 100%;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  color: #e4eff5;
  font-size: 12.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-radius: 11px;
  transition: 0.15s;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.bd-sec-btn:hover {
  border-color: var(--bd-mint);
  color: var(--bd-mint);
  background: rgba(69, 230, 176, 0.08);
}

/* Responsive Breakpoints */
@media (max-width: 1240px) {
  .bd-top-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .bd-qstack { grid-column: span 2; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .bd-bot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .bd-sec-card { grid-column: span 2; }
}

@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .bd-top-grid, .bd-bot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .bd-qstack { grid-column: auto; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .bd-qbtn.pri { grid-column: span 2; }
  .bd-sec-card { grid-column: auto; }
  .bd-greet-row { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
}
</span></code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="8">Шаг 2 из 2: Полная замена скрипта с векторными SVG-иконками (<code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="61">js/bankdash-pro.js</code>)</h3><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="9"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><span>Откройте файл </span><b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="14"><code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="14">js/bankdash-pro.js</code></b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><span>Выделите </span><b data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="9">всё</b><span> содержимое (</span><code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="25">Ctrl + A</code><span>) и удалите его.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="9,2,0"><span>Вставьте этот код целиком и сохраните (</span><code data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="39">Ctrl + S</code><span>):</span></p></li></ol><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="--animation-duration: 900ms;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-168 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1018527668-168 ng-ani