ion"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c2769656198-171 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c2769656198-171"><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c2769656198-171"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c2769656198-171"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c2769656198-171" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2769656198="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2769656198-171"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2769656198-171"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" _nghost-ng-c1736667941="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="polite"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini said</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1927987384="" _nghost-ng-c212636251=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c212636251="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c212636251="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c743029074="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c743029074="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c743029074="" _nghost-ng-c3963261838="" id="message-content-id-r_04e866872eaaddaa" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3963261838="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_04e866872eaaddaa" aria-busy="false" aria-live="polite" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token" id="p-rc_afef44efe1a4e0f0-137"><span data-path-to-node="0,0" class="">Да, конечно! И главное — мы сделаем это так, чтобы картинка <b data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="60">не терялась при переходе в <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="87">app.html</code></b>, отлично смотрелась и на компьютере, и на телефоне, а все детали (шёлковая бирюзовая волна на карте, цвета кольцевого графика, логотипы монет и мобильная адаптация без багов) совпадали 1-в-1 с макетом (<code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="298">image_c587a9.jpg</code>)</span><span data-path-to-node="0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="0,2" class="">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from JPG: image_c587a9.jpg. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" id="ow142" __is_owner="true"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">image_c587a9.jpg</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1">Шаг 1: Сохраните фото гор в папку проекта</h3><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2" data-citation-layout="consolidated" id="p-rc_afef44efe1a4e0f0-140"><li id="p-rc_afef44efe1a4e0f0-138"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="2,0,0,0">Сохраните первое присланное вами панорамное фото с заснеженными горами (<code data-path-to-node="2,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="72">image_c58788.png</code>) в корень вашего проекта рядом с <code data-path-to-node="2,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="122">app.html</code> и назовите файл <b data-path-to-node="2,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="147"><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="147">nordic-bg.png</code></b></span><span data-path-to-node="2,0,0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3508047400="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3508047400="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="2,0,0,2">.
<i data-path-to-node="2,0,0,2" data-index-in-node="2">(Важно: в CSS ниже прописан запасной вариант — даже если файл не найден или грузится, автоматически подставится плавный нордический фон без «битых» картинок).</i></span></p></li><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4063988950="" class="consolidated-sources"><!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4063988950="" _nghost-ng-c493255331="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from PNG: image_c58788.png. Press Enter to open sources dialogue." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" id="ow141" __is_owner="true"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c493255331="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 48ch;">image_c58788.png</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></ol><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4">Шаг 2: Обновите <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="16">css/bankdash-pro.css</code> (1-в-1 как на макете + идеальная мобильная версия)</h3><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><span>Откройте файл </span><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="14"><code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="14">css/bankdash-pro.css</code></b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><span>Выделите </span><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="9">всё</b><span> (</span><code data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="14">Ctrl + A</code><span class="">),</span><span class=""> удалите и вставьте этот код целиком (</span><code data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="62" class="">Ctrl + S</code><span class="">):</span></p></li></ol><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="--animation-duration: 900ms;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-172 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1018527668-172 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8wNGU4NjY4NzJlYWFkZGFhIiwiY19lMGI1ODE1NWUzYmI3OWVkIixudWxsLCJyY19hZmVmNDRlZmUxYTRlMGYwIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJ1IixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1018527668-172"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1018527668-172"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c1018527668-172 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="ng-tns-c1018527668-172">CSS</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1018527668-172 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1018527668="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1018527668-172 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1669243914="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-35" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1669243914="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button